pyprojectbuild (0.1.1-1~resolute) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Implement modular project layout and target path handling for CLI operations.
  * Add automated local .secrets credentials management for PPA publishing.
  * Configure robust extend-diff-ignore filtering pulled from .gitignore and virtual environments (.venv).
  * Add multi-series Ubuntu PPA publishing supporting noble and resolute with dynamic -sa and -sd archive flags.
  * Add dynamic parsing of build and runtime dependencies from pyproject.toml.
  * Prevent overwriting existing release entries in debian/changelog.

 -- Sat Naing Tun <satnaingtun.snt@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:00:10 +0700

